            "type": "text",
            "text": "You create a replenishing protective bubble of fresh, temperate air around the target. The shell of air enables the target to breathe even underwater or in a vacuum, protects from severe cold and heat, and grants a +1 status bonus to the target's saves against inhaled dangers such as inhaled poisons and "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "f3141756-1e05-510a-b997-772d9ada7ecd"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "7aaa0d7f-6536-5890-be93-f8f9e5a51833"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Heightened (6th)",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The bubble lasts until your next preparation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Heightened (8th)",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The bubble lasts until your next preparation, protects against extreme cold and heat, and grants a +2 status bonus instead of +1."
          }
        ]
      }
